=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                    ‍\n                   </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n               </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             关于Papayo品种\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTlhGBze2XWbvlCJmNjK7xrEjMSq0N83Pic1HSZFPiblfgiaQG8QxI6RicXrXCV49YBBgtVaK30X6TzxicA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=13\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 661px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             帕帕尤鲜果\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             帕帕尤的咖啡樱桃很有特色，形状细长，它的名字大概率来自于它形似木瓜果实。帕帕尤品种在慧兰省以外的地区非常罕见，人们对它如何出现在哥伦比亚知之甚少。它最初被认为是卡杜拉的突变，但世界咖啡研究中心的基因测序表明它与埃塞俄比亚的原生种有密切关系。\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             关于Tabi‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Tabi是哥伦比亚咖啡研究机构CENICAFE内部研发并推广的一个改良品种，取名于当地土著部落的语言，意为“好”。从1961年开始到2002年正式推出历时40余年。Tabi是人工杂交Typica, Bourbon和Timor Hybrid后得到的优良品种，其中最显著的特征是对叶锈病的抵抗力极强。这也是Orlando像慧兰大部分农民一样选择种植Tabi的原因。Tabi品种还有一个优势是沿袭了铁皮卡和波旁的优质杯品表现，可以高密度种植且适应高海拔，这对大多数种植条件一般的农户来说是一个优势品种。\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             关于绿宝石庄园‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTnBjDmS4d2xnZH4fictEERX1EMIIPuTCPS9Q97fObm6UANpicnaCL62GSEttQy6aLDrDUp1AucvcPUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=13\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;vertical-align: inherit;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.034em;width: 661px;visibility: visible !important;'/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n             绿宝石庄园\n            </span>\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             绿宝石由Norbey Quimbayo和他的妻子打理，Norbey继承了父亲庄园后一开始他跟其它咖农一样生产商业咖啡，但2006年金融危机危机和咖啡价格下跌之后，利润开始逐渐下滑。Norbey决定到哥伦比亚咖啡学院研修，在那里他学习了很多不同的方法来改善他的咖啡品质，从而获得更高的收入和溢价。\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TMtZic4lguS5W1IOh4iamxWnGl57KvrIrF5vHWeUTkWJRKzSypLsicPCI0ozibfwWChhjUFbEggMzHxQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             庄园主Norbey Quimbayo\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              关于处理\n             </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             粉波旁蜜处理，在Norbey定义是半水洗Semi Lavado，与Papayo的蜜处理相同的前半阶段筛选果子，脱皮，不同的是脱皮后带着果胶的豆子在发酵桶中厌氧静置42小时，然后再用水简单的冲洗下，因为有过静置发酵，所以果胶有分解但是因为这里天气太冷了，果胶还是会有一小部分没有完全分解松落，所以最终这个产品可能类似于哥斯达黎加的白蜜处理，我们拿到后测下来觉得它有相比水洗更为细腻和有层次的酸质，这种风味特征是在很多蜜处理产品上都能体现出来的，所以将它定义为蜜处理产品。\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ShZB6vgULdeb2oIXLwf0716x48rFc8DKlbv6EeNnFXKcEUKgPSK2bBUDKjZemLu0olY1LcvibtaAQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             粉波旁蜜处理（庄园叫Semi Lavado 半水洗）‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             2023年十月，我有机会亲自去到Norbey家，对我感触最深的是整个家庭是一个非常朴实，很积极向上的咖农家庭，妻子和女儿们都和Norbey一起经营着家里的咖啡生意，也有一个远景目标去奋斗‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ShZB6vgULdeb2oIXLwf07147oTpqVhP7fNCbDUnc4wMdXJsuTqsQaVBzic7AGuQtgPeib5zU51OaDA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ShZB6vgULdeb2oIXLwf0719AKWukXl73HybOEAOaYGsqMUHRiaDkqjjbWmOv92hXmUeqzzh47Wuiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Norbey小女儿画的关于家里咖啡和梦想的画‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ShZB6vgULdeb2oIXLwf071ospKlX5tOr0v44de7N90Pl2l0PgibnEeeKgCyiao3icnt4feQIRBicWNHw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n             从右往左Norbey的小女儿，大女儿，儿子，Norbey，Norbey的领导，我，Leonor和Leonor的哥伦产区品控负责Sandra（后面的画都是Norbey小女儿画的）\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              关于本批次处理\n             </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             上一个产季去到农场，我就想可不可以做一个处理的调整，于是就有了这三个批次；处理上的调整的环节是去掉了发酵后的第二个有氧或者厌氧的阶段，简化了处理流程和发酵阶段的时间，希望能轻盈一些，但又同时又层次来呈现一些细腻感的风味特征：\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             厌氧蜜处理批次：\n            </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               鲜果筛选\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               鲜果袋内发酵3天\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               鲜果脱皮，然后晒床缓慢晾晒\n              </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               厌氧日晒批次：\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               鲜果筛选\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               鲜果袋内发酵3天\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               晒床晾晒\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n            </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZfP6JRomfrYRJyo2D4Tf0NvibBUZu9UP4VMYvReaLlu6bc42JoO24QdA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 200px;\"/>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
